B.c6n=s(["When you leave an active property and return within 3 hours, the app detects a short supply/break gap.","Merge Gaps Option: Bridges your departure back into one continuous property visit log.",'Away / Break Option: Logs a separate "Away / Break" or Hardware Store run record for strict IRS audit separation.'],t.s)
