B.caF=s(["Each time log records trip mileage and automatically computes the tax deduction at the standard IRS rate.",'The Dashboard "Tax Mileage" KPI card shows your year-to-date deductible dollar value and total miles driven.',"Open the Mileage Ledger (/mileage) to review origin/destination trips, vehicles, and export IRS-compliant mileage CSVs."],t.s)
