B.c61=s(["Step 1: Open Equipment & Tools (/equipment).",'Step 2: Register tools (e.g., "Scaffolding", "Shingle bar", "Stand up Air") with purchase cost, serial number, warranty expiry, and MACRS depreciation class.','Step 3: Filter by Location or Holder (e.g., held by "jon Borean" at "178 Sheridan") and reassign checkouts in one click.'],t.s)
