B.c7Z=s(["Open Marketplace Hub (/marketplace) to see all active listings, vacancy marketing status, and lead inquiries.",'Click "Generate Ad Copy" to produce platform-formatted text with rent, deposit, pet policies, amenities, and photo attachments.',"Unique Application Link: Every listing includes a direct /apply?listingId=... link that pre-selects the unit on the prospect portal.",'Click "Mark Lease Signed" once a prospect is placed to automatically delist the unit and route into tenant onboarding.'],t.s)
B.aKa=new A.ex("marketplace_listings","TRACK_5","Tenants, QR & Leasing","Marketplace Listings, Rental Syndication & Lead Capture",B.F3,"Promote vacant units across Facebook Marketplace, Kijiji, Craigslist, and Zillow with 1-click formatted copy and direct application links.",B.c7Z,"Share your direct application link on social groups so prospective tenants apply immediately from their phone.","/marketplace")
B.bmD=s(["Upload or photograph paper rental applications: on-device OCR extracts applicant name, phone, employer, and monthly income.","Screen applicants through Pending \u2192 Under Review \u2192 Approved \u2192 Declined stages with reference verification.","1-Tap Lease Conversion: Approving an applicant launches the Create Lease Wizard carrying all applicant records directly into the lease.","Formal Adverse Action: If an applicant is rejected, generate compliant adverse action notices with lawful statutory reasons."],t.s)
B.aK6=new A.ex("paper_applications_ocr","TRACK_5","Tenants, QR & Leasing","Paper Application OCR Scanner, Tenant Screening & Adverse Action",B.QJ,"Digitize paper rental applications via camera OCR, process background reviews, and issue statutory adverse action decline notices.",B.bmD,null,"/applications")
B.ccp=s(['Tenant Portal Admin (/tenant-portal-admin): generate printable "Vacant Unit Showing" QR signs for front windows.',"Sidewalk prospects scan to view photos, unit specs, rent criteria, and schedule a walk-through.","Android ShowingReminderManager fires automated push notifications 1 hour and 15 minutes before scheduled appointments.",'Generate "Mechanical & Turnover Hub" QR codes for boiler and utility rooms so maintenance crews access equipment specs without logging in.'],t.s)
B.aKl=new A.ex("showing_and_turnover_qr","TRACK_5","Tenants, QR & Leasing","Vacant Showing QR Codes, Scheduled Reminders & Mechanical QR Hub",B.wi,"Print window showing QR codes for sidewalk prospect marketing, receive automated walk-through reminders, and set up mechanical room QR hubs.",B.ccp,null,"/tenant-portal-admin")
B.c4k=s(["Landlord Toolkit (/landlord-toolkit) Radar tab flags leases entering their 90-day rent increase notice window.","Statutory Rent Increase dialog auto-calculates lawful increase amounts based on local provincial/state statutory guidelines (e.g. Ontario 2.5%).","Projects lawful delivery dates (mail vs personal service) and pre-fills Form N1 notices ready for printing or digital delivery.","Updates active lease rent schedules upon service."],t.s)
B.aK7=new A.ex("statutory_rent_increase","TRACK_5","Tenants, QR & Leasing","Statutory Rent Increase Calculator & Jurisdiction Notice Generator",B.Ri,"Calculate lawful annual rent increases conforming to Ontario LTB 2.5% statutory guidelines or US municipal rules, pre-filling Form N1 notices.",B.c4k,null,"/notices")
B.cdH=s(["Monthly Rent Billing & RTA s.109 Receipts: Launch from Rent Roll (/rent-roll) on Web or the Receipt icon in Android SQL Property Hub to generate monthly rent charges and official Ontario RTA s.109 rent receipts.","Provincial Standard Lease Engine: Generate compliant Ontario 2229E, BC RTB-1, or Alberta RTA standard lease drafts directly from active applications or units.",'30/60/90/120-Day Milestone Automator: Open Planning Hub (/planning-hub) > "30/60/90d Milestone Engine" to preview and generate renewal drafts, make-ready turnovers, and seasonal internal Jobs or vendor Work Orders.',"Daily Compliance Digest & Key Vault: Review urgent lease/alarm alerts, 24-hour Notices of Entry, lockbox codes, and preventative auto-dispatch rules via LandlordMetadataController."],t.s)
B.aKj=new A.ex("canadian_billing_standard_lease_digest","TRACK_5","Tenants, QR & Leasing","Canadian Standard Lease, Monthly Billing, RTA s.109 Receipts & Milestone Engine",B.EL,"Issue Ontario 2229E / BC RTB-1 / AB RTA standard leases, RTA s.109 rent receipts, 30/60/90-day milestone automations, and daily compliance digests.",B.cdH,"Use the Vendor Quote Comparison & Variance Reconciler to classify approved invoices cleanly between CRA Form T776 Line 8960 (Current Repairs) and CCA Class 8 (CapEx).","/leasing-hub")
B.bFi=s(["Step 1: Manage Property Owners (/owners) and People & Contractors (/people).","Step 2: Enable Team Sharing per property and assign roles: Owner, Co-owner, Manager, Contractor, or Viewer.",'Step 3: Every log supports 3 Visibility Levels: "Private" (only you), "Owners only" (you + property owners), or "Shared" (everyone on that property).'],t.s)
B.aKo=new A.ex("property_sharing_privacy","TRACK_4","Team, Dispatch & Approvals","Per-Property Sharing, Visibility Levels & Owner Contacts",B.Rb,"Share specific properties with co-owners, managers, or contractors while keeping private properties 100% private.",B.bFi,"Contractors are automatically restricted from seeing portfolio financials, owner profit margins, or other contractors' hourly rates.","/people")
B.aL2=new A.Q(57510,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.c4E=s(["Dispatch Queue (/dispatch-queue): Create field assignments with Person, Property, Priority (Low/Normal/High/Urgent), and Due Date.","Status Lifecycle: Assignments progress cleanly through Queued \u2192 In Progress \u2192 Done (or Cancelled).","Team Live Board (/team-live-board): View real-time worker cards showing who is actively on-site, idle, or holding overdue assignments."],t.s)
B.aKd=new A.ex("dispatch_live_board","TRACK_4","Team, Dispatch & Approvals","Supervisor Dispatch Queue & Team Live Board",B.aL2,"Assign prioritized field jobs with due dates and monitor who is currently clocked in across all properties.",B.c4E,null,"/dispatch-queue")
B.cf2=s(['Step 1: Open the Approval Queue (/approvals) or click the "Pending Approvals" badge on the Dashboard.','Step 2: Review submitted time logs\u2014click "Approve" to lock the entry for billing/payroll, or "Reject" with a comment.',"Step 3: Two Golden Rules: (1) Only the creator of a log can edit its raw times; owners approve or reject. (2) Once Approved, a log is locked from edits unless an Owner resets its approval status."],t.s)
B.aKI=new A.ex("approval_queue_payroll","TRACK_4","Team, Dispatch & Approvals","Time Log Approval Queue & Payroll Pack Export",B.qV,"Review pending contractor/team hours, approve or reject with comments, and lock approved logs for payroll.",B.cf2,null,"/approvals")
B.aL9=new A.Q(57621,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.caI=s(["Android Field Diagnostics: Shake phone or tap \u22ee > Report Bug. Freezes active screen, previews screenshot, attaches last 100 logcat lines.","Web Triage Hub: Open App Health (/app-health) to monitor SQL Server CoreApi connectivity and review incoming bug tickets.","Lifecycle Management: Reports progress through Pending \u2192 Approved \u2192 Fixed \u2192 Dismissed via BugReportsController.","Autonomous Resolution: Use the /fix-bug-reports skill to automatically resolve approved tickets with logcat and screenshot context."],t.s)
B.aKG=new A.ex("bug_reports","TRACK_4","Team, Dispatch & Approvals","In-App Bug Reporting & Shake-to-Report Diagnostics",B.aL9,"Instantly report bugs from the field by shaking your phone or tapping Report Bug\u2014captures screenshot, device specs, and logcat output.",B.caI,"Shaking your phone works during active time tracking without interrupting your running timer or losing uncommitted notes.","/app-health")
B.aLR=new A.Q(58310,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.ceR=s(["Step 1: Open Property Managers (/property-managers) from the sidebar or Settings > Property Managers Directory on Android.","Step 2: Create manager profiles with company name, contact, phone, email, website, license number, and serviced cities (e.g., Sault Ste. Marie, Sudbury).","Step 3: Set Default Fee Rate % (e.g. 6.0% of gross rents) and Tax Rate % (e.g. 13.0% HST). Assigned properties inherit these rates for automated fee calculations.","Step 4: Audit annual and monthly management fee invoices tied to Canadian CRA Form T776 Line 8871 (Management and Administration Fees).",'Step 5: Toggle between "Directory by Manager" and "Browse by City" to see coverage, unit counts, and assigned addresses.'],t.s)
B.aKx=new A.ex("property_managers","TRACK_4","Team, Dispatch & Approvals","Property Managers Directory, City Service Coverage & CRA Line 8871 Fee Audit",B.aLR,"Manage external property managers, assign managed properties, track multi-city service coverage, and audit CRA Line 8871 management fee expenses.",B.ceR,"Linking a Property Manager directly inside the Property Form automatically updates property detail views and scopes invoice audit logs to that manager company!","/property-managers")
