B.aKp=new A.ex("coowner_settlement_rbac_conflicts","TRACK_4","Team, Dispatch & Approvals","Co-Owner Settlement PDF, Server RBAC, Sync Conflicts & Audit Timeline",B.Qx,"Generate co-owner monthly settlement PDFs, enforce property-level SQL RBAC, resolve sync conflicts, inspect entity audit timelines, and track QR scans.",B.bR3,"When pending SQL sync conflicts exist, Android shows a Dashboard banner so you can resolve them before overwriting field edits.","/approvals")
B.c9g=s(["The Dashboard KPI banner tracks your cumulative hours across all active properties (e.g., 171h 2m tracked toward the 750h annual goal).","Every time log captures the exact timestamp, GPS verification, work category, linked job, and before/after photos required to substantiate hours in an audit."],t.s)
