B.cdB=s(["Financials Hub (/financials) & Property Profitability (/property-profitability): promote repair expenses to CapEx to protect operating deductions.","CRA CCA Loss-Guard automatically calculates available Class 1 (building) and Class 8 (equipment) depreciation pools without triggering rental loss penalties.","Co-Owner Distributions: calculates equity splits (e.g. Darren Ford 50% / Victoria Spinelli 50%) after automated property management fees."],t.s)
B.aKE=new A.ex("capex_and_cca","TRACK_2","Tax, Export & Cloud Sync","CapEx Promotion Wizard, CRA CCA Loss-Guard & Co-Owner Tax Equity",B.w5,"Promote major repairs to CapEx, manage Canadian CRA Class 1 (4%) and Class 8 (20%) CCA pools with half-year rules, and compute co-owner distributions.",B.cdB,"The CCA Loss-Guard prevents claiming depreciation that would create or increase a rental loss\u2014protecting you automatically from Canadian CRA audit penalties.","/property-profitability")
B.c7W=s(["Step 1: Open the CRA T776 Tax Center dialog on Android (Dashboard > CRA T776 Tax Center) or Financials (/financials) & Profitability (/property-profitability) on Flutter Web.","Step 2: Review Part 1 Gross Rents and operating expense lines (Line 8810 Office, Line 8871 Management Fees, Line 8960 Maintenance/Repairs, Line 9180 Property Taxes, Line 9220 Utilities).","Step 3: Review Part 2 Net Income Before CCA. Per CRA Income Tax Regulation 1100(11), CCA can never create or increase a net rental loss.","Step 4: Configure Part 3 Capital Cost Allowance (CCA) pools: Class 1 (4% building), Class 8 (20% appliances/equipment), Class 10/10.1 (30% motor vehicles), and Class 12 (100% tools <$500).","Step 5: Automated Half-Year Rule: Only 50% of net capital additions in the year are eligible for CCA deduction in the first year.","Step 6: Allocate Co-Ownership / Partnership % splits (e.g., Darren Ford 50% / Victoria Spinelli 50%) and export complete CRA T776 CSV schedules."],t.s)
B.aKi=new A.ex("cra_t776_tax_center","TRACK_2","Tax, Export & Cloud Sync","Canadian CRA Form T776 Rental Income Statement & CCA Loss-Guard Tax Center",B.EJ,"Prepare Canadian CRA Form T776 rental income and expense statements, manage CCA Class 1, 8, 10, 10.1, and 12 pools, enforce the half-year acquisition rule, and protect against rental losses.",B.c7W,"The CRA CCA Loss-Guard automatically caps your total allowable CCA claim to your net rental income before CCA\u2014guaranteeing you never trigger an automatic CRA audit flag from creating a rental loss with depreciation!","/financials")
B.bSX=s(["Step 1: Open CashFlow Guardian (/cash-flow on Web or Dashboard \u22ee > CashFlow Guardian on Android) and visit the Setup Wizard tab to copy your workspace inbound email address.","Step 2: Forward bank balance, deposit, debit, and Interac e-Transfer alerts\u2014dedicated parsers automatically extract account balances and matching transactions across CIBC, RBC, TD, BMO, Tangerine, Scotiabank, and Interac.","Step 3: Configure Recurring Obligations (mortgages, utilities, property taxes, insurance) on Weekly, Bi-Weekly, Semi-Monthly (1st & 15th), Monthly, Quarterly, or Annual cadences with automatic due-date advancement.","Step 4: Monitor the 7, 14, or 30-day running balance Timeline and receive automatic FCM push notifications before any projected account shortfall."],t.s)
B.aKF=new A.ex("cashflow_guardian","TRACK_2","Tax, Export & Cloud Sync","CashFlow Guardian & Canadian Multi-Bank Alert Parser",B.f2,"Forward bank alert emails for Interac e-Transfer, CIBC, RBC, TD, BMO, Tangerine, and Scotiabank to project 7/14/30-day cash flow and prevent shortfalls.",B.bSX,"Use the Test Email Simulator in Setup Wizard to verify your forwarding rules and watch a sample RBC/TD/Interac alert update your timeline immediately.","/cash-flow")
B.c7o=s(['Open from Rent Roll (/rent-roll) > "Canadian CRA & LTB/RTB Suite", Command Palette (Ctrl+K), or the Shield icon in Android SQL Property Hub.',"Tab 1 \u2014 CRA T5018 & CCA Recapture: Audit subcontractor Box 22 payments (>$500) + GST/HST, export official T5018 PDFs, and simulate ITA s.45(2)/s.45(3) Change-in-Use 100% taxable CCA recapture.","Tab 2 \u2014 LTB/RTB Dossier & AGRI CapEx: Compile Ontario LTB (N4/N12/N13/L1/L2) or BC RTB evidence dossiers with PDF export, and calculate Above-Guideline Rent Increases (ON L5 / BC RTB-52).","Tab 3 \u2014 Mortgage Stress-Tester & CRA Line 8710: Model semi-annual Canadian mortgage renewals and trace deductible Line 8710 interest.","Tab 4 \u2014 Turnover SLA & Move-In Gate: Track make-ready cost-per-turn benchmarks and enforce Tenant Liability Insurance ($1M\u2013$2M) + Hydro transfer before key release.","Tab 5 \u2014 Freeze/Leak Watchdog, Route Audit & QR Passport: Triage vacant winter freeze/hydro spikes (1-tap Job vs. WorkOrder), verify CRA tiered vehicle logs ($0.72/$0.66 km), and export Appliance OEM Warranty Claim PDFs."],t.s)
B.aKu=new A.ex("canadian_ten_feature_suite","TRACK_2","Tax, Export & Cloud Sync","Canadian 10-Feature CRA T5018, LTB/RTB Tribunal, AGRI & Operations Suite",B.qV,"All-in-one 5-tab Canadian suite for CRA Form T5018 slips, LTB/RTB Tribunal Evidence Dossiers, AGRI CapEx, Mortgage Line 8710, CCA Recapture, and QR Passports.",B.c7o,'When the Vacant Freeze & Leak Watchdog flags a hydro or moisture spike, choose "Internal Job" for your crew or "Vendor WorkOrder" for an outside plumber right from the alert.',"/rent-roll")
